DEEP = {
"Export and Import Business": ["Pick one product and one destination; study buyer standards, tariffs and shipping time.","Classify goods with the common customs code, check licences, and use a licensed customs broker where required.","Quote with clear delivery terms, packing, insurance and payment security.","Order flow: quote, contract, production, inspection, booking, customs, delivery, payment.","Risks: misclassification, delay, damage and payment default; use inspection, insurance and secured payment.","Train staff on documents and deadlines; one error can hold a container.","Price in two currencies and add freight, duties and exchange-rate buffer.","Grow with repeat orders and consolidated shipments."],
"Financing Start-ups": ["Founders want money and help; investors want evidence; write both profiles.","Raising money may bring securities rules; confirm what is allowed before offering to the public.","Offer stages: small grant or loan first, larger funding after milestones.","Process: screen, interview, due diligence, terms, funding, milestone review.","Risk of funding weak plans; score team, market, product and traction.","Train the review panel on fair scoring and conflicts of interest.","Track funds out, follow-on rate and returns; expect most to fail.","Grow with a portfolio and visible founder success stories."],
"Food Trucking": ["Know your pitch: office lunch, event, night street; each sets menu and hours.","Vehicles and food need city permits, health inspection and fire safety equipment.","Short menu of five items, priced and timed for under 3 minutes per order.","Daily: prep, load, drive, set up, serve, clean, count, restock.","Gas, hot oil and cross-contamination are core hazards; fire extinguisher and cold chain log.","Train staff in hygiene, cash handling and queues.","Margin per meal after waste, fuel and permits; weather days matter.","Grow with regular spots and catering orders."],
"Bed and Breakfast Business": ["Guests: leisure, business and family; ask what they want from a stay.","Lodging follows local registration, tax and safety rules; guest registration duties apply.","Sell a stay: room, breakfast, welcome and local tips.","Housekeeping cycle: check-out, clean, inspect, reset, check-in.","Fire exits, wiring and food hygiene need checks.","Train hosts in welcome and complaint recovery.","Occupancy times price; seasons change cash.","Grow with direct bookings and reviews."],
"Hostel or Hotel Business": ["Define guests: backpackers, business, groups; each wants different services.","Hotels need licences, fire and safety approvals, and guest registration.","Package room types, meals and extras; keep rates consistent across channels.","Front desk, housekeeping, maintenance and breakfast run on written checklists.","Fire, security and food safety are priorities; drill evacuation.","Train for service and shifts; cross-train staff.","Revenue per available room guides price; track occupancy daily.","Grow by direct booking and corporate contracts."],
"Carpentry": ["Customers want fit, finish and timing; take measurements and photos.","Register trade or MEI; wood sourcing should be legal with documentation.","Quote with drawing, materials and finish; show samples.","Steps: measure, cut list, cut, join, sand, finish, install.","Saws, dust and chemicals injure; guard machines, wear gear, extract dust.","Train helpers on tool use before power tools.","Include waste, glue and finish in cost; invoice by stage.","Grow by repeat clients and portfolio photos."],
"Event Organization and Management": ["Clarify purpose, guest list, budget and date before anything else.","Events need venue permits, fire approval, music and security rules where applicable.","Offer a plan with a run sheet and a supplier list.","Timeline from 12 weeks out: book, brief, confirm, rehearse, run, close.","Crowd safety, power and weather are key risks; plan exits and backups.","Train the team to run to the script and radio calls.","Budget lines with 10% contingency; pay suppliers on agreed dates.","Grow by showing past events and client feedback."],
"Franchise Business": ["Test the model in at least two outlets before selling it.","Franchise offers need a clear disclosure document with fees, duties and term under Brazilian franchise law.","Package: brand, manual, training, supply, support.","Operations manual covers every daily task with photos and times.","Quality drift between outlets is the risk; audit with a scorecard.","Train franchisees before opening and monthly after.","Unit economics: investment, royalty, payback in months.","Grow only where outlets meet the scorecard."],
"Manufacturing Business": ["Know buyer specs, volumes and delivery windows.","Factory licences, fire, environment and labour rules; certification where products are regulated.","Offer a specified product with tolerance, lead time and warranty.","Plan: materials, process steps, inspection points, packing, dispatch.","Machine guarding, lockout and noise are hazards.","Train operators with work instructions.","Cost per batch includes scrap; track yield.","Grow with lean improvement and a second shift."],
"Apparels and Accessories": ["Know target body sizes, style and season; collect fit feedback.","Textile labels must show fibre, size and care; respect trademark and consumer rules.","Plan a small range, colours and a size curve.","Design, sample, fit, grade, produce, finish, ship.","Return rate from poor fit is the risk; offer size guides.","Train sewers and checkers; set quality limits.","Price with markdown allowance; stock risk is real.","Grow through limited drops and repeat customers."],
"Beauty": ["Ask about skin, hair type, and time; keep client cards.","Salons need health surveillance rules, licensed products and trained staff.","Menu of treatments, times, prices and aftercare advice.","Sanitise tools between clients, patch test where needed.","Allergic reactions and infection need records and protocol.","Train for consultation and safe products.","Time per service decides price; avoid empty slots.","Grow with rebooking and packages."],
"Dental": ["Understand patient fear and cost; offer prevention first.","Dentists hold council registration; clinics need health licences and waste handling.","Offer check-up, hygiene, restorative plans with written estimates.","Sterilisation cycle: clean, pack, sterilise, store; record each cycle.","Cross-infection and radiation are risks; follow shielding and logs.","Train assistants on chairside and infection control.","Chair-hour value drives price; track cancellations.","Grow through recalls and referrals."],
"Cleaning Services": ["Segment homes, offices and post-works.","Register business, insure, and meet labour rules for staff.","Offer a checklist-based service with frequency and a quality guarantee.","Plan route, supplies, tasks, check, sign-off.","Chemical mixing and slips; label, dilute correctly, wet-floor signs.","Train staff on products and respect for property.","Price per hour or per area; staff cost is the main line.","Grow by contracts and supervision."],
"Warehousing and Storage Services": ["Know what clients store: dry, chilled, bulky.","Warehouses need fire approval, tax documents and licences for special goods.","Offer per pallet, per day pricing with receiving and picking.","Receive, check, put away, pick, pack, dispatch; cycle counts weekly.","Fire load, racking collapse and forklift accidents.","Train forklift drivers and keep certificates.","Utilisation percent drives profit; avoid empty racks.","Grow with value-added services."],
"Transportation and Courier Services": ["Know load types, routes and delivery windows.","Operators need vehicle registration, driver licences and cargo insurance; follow driver hours rules.","Offer fixed price lanes or per kilometre rates.","Plan: load, secure, route, track, deliver, proof.","Fatigue, overload and theft; enforce rest and secure loads.","Train drivers in safe driving and cargo care.","Cost per kilometre includes fuel, tyres, tolls and maintenance.","Grow by filling return trips."],
"3D Printing Business": ["Customers: designers, makers, small firms; ask about strength and finish.","Respect design copyright; do not print protected designs without rights.","Offer material choices, tolerances and lead times.","Prepare file, slice, print, post-process, inspect, pack.","Hot parts, fumes and resin skin contact; ventilate and wear gloves.","Train staff on file checks and maintenance.","Cost per part includes failed prints; track failure rate.","Grow with small-batch production."],
"App Development": ["Find a user pain in one sentence; test with a clickable mock-up.","Data protection law (LGPD) applies; app stores have review rules.","Define first release with must-have features only.","Sprint: plan, build, test, release, learn; keep a backlog.","Security bugs and data loss; code review and backups.","Train team on code standards and testing.","Cost is people time; track burn and runway.","Grow by usage data and retention."],
"Small and Medium Entrepreneur Business": ["Know your best customers and what they value; keep a simple customer list.","Pick the right regime (MEI or other), file taxes on time, keep invoices.","Make a one-page offer and price list.","Weekly routine: sales, delivery, cash, follow-up.","Cash shortage kills; keep a 13-week cash view.","Hire the first person with a clear role card.","Separate personal and business money; pay yourself a fixed amount.","Grow one thing at a time."],
"Outsourcing Services": ["Clients want lower cost and steady quality; define the process you will run.","Contracts state data duties, service levels and penalties; LGPD roles are named.","Offer scope, volume bands, service levels and reporting.","Hand-over, training, live run, quality checks, monthly review.","Data leaks and errors; access control and double checks.","Train agents on scripts and escalation.","Price per transaction or per head; utilisation matters.","Grow by service level performance."],
"Electronics Sales & Repair Services": ["Customers want honest diagnosis and fair price; give a written estimate.","Register the business; consumer law gives warranty rights; handle e-waste properly.","Offer diagnosis fee, repair price and warranty.","Check-in, diagnose, approve, repair, test, return.","Static and battery fire risk; ESD mat and safe battery storage.","Train technicians on tools and data privacy.","Parts cost and turnaround time; track return rate.","Grow with trade-ins and refurbished sales."],
}
